{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52246","headline":"诗（幷序） 七 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大有愚（一作「禺」）痴君，独身无儿子。\n广贪多觅财，养奴多养婢。\n伺（张改作「司」，项以爲不误。\n）命门前唤，不容（一作「客」）别隣里。\n死得四片板，一条黄衾被。\n钱财奴婢用，任将别经（一作「絰」）纪。\n有钱不解用，空手入都市（一作「示」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}